    <briefdescription>
<para>Energy-threshold-based Voice Activity Detector. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>Divides the PCM buffer into fixed-length frames and computes the root-mean-square (RMS) energy of each frame. Consecutive frames whose RMS exceeds <computeroutput><ref refid="structthemis_1_1whisper_1_1_vad_config_1affff38e953df857267a6500da44cc638" kindref="member">VadConfig::energy_threshold</ref></computeroutput> are merged into a single <ref refid="structthemis_1_1whisper_1_1_speech_segment" kindref="compound">SpeechSegment</ref>. Segments shorter than <computeroutput><ref refid="structthemis_1_1whisper_1_1_vad_config_1ac2e4c6e1fd75c8bdba5d777356d526b5" kindref="member">VadConfig::min_speech_ms</ref></computeroutput> are discarded.</para>
<para>Performance: &lt; 5 ms per 1-second chunk at 16 kHz on a modern CPU. </para>
    </detaileddescription>
